# Line endings are pinned to LF on every platform. This is not cosmetic:
# deploy/sccm/Detect-AIOpsReader.ps1 embeds the SHA256 of deploy/jea/AIOpsReader.psrc, and a
# checkout that rewrote LF to CRLF (Git for Windows does by default) would change that hash,
# fail the unit test that pins it, and make the SCCM baseline report every server as
# non-compliant. Windows PowerShell 5.1 reads LF scripts without issue.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
